WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:01.919
Dear Viola.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:02.753
Dear Sandra.

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:03.712
Thank you, Jane.

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:06.715
...for inspiring me to stand up for myself
and make sure that I'm heard.

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:10.802
You never know what the impact
of your actions are gonna be,

00:00:10.886 --> 00:00:12.930
and then you read a letter like this.

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:20.145
As an athlete, we are able to use
our platform to help people

00:00:20.229 --> 00:00:21.271
see what's going on.

00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:26.777
To quote Sandra Oh,
"It's an honor to be Asian!"

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.238
You can have profound ripple effects.

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:34.868
There is a core narrative about all of us.

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:37.454
She's too hard, she's too old,
she's too much of everything.

00:00:37.538 --> 00:00:39.498
And in many instances, it's wrong.

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:44.378
There was a talent show, and I sang.

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:46.755
Instantly, the bullying stopped.

00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:50.342
It was the beginning of
understanding my own power. 

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.681
I thought, "If Malala can do
so much at a young age,

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:56.807
maybe I can too."

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:59.852
So many people around the world
are speaking out.

00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:01.770
Dear Ava, I'd be willing to bet

00:01:01.854 --> 00:01:03.856
that you didn't realize 
the hundreds of children

00:01:03.939 --> 00:01:05.691
you'd be saving from incarceration.

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:08.861
Wow... that makes me emotional.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:10.445
Dear Laird.

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:11.989
I've been able to accomplish things

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.741
which many believed were impossible
with my condition.

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:17.494
I owe this enlightened mindset...

00:01:17.578 --> 00:01:18.287
To you, Laird.

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:22.499
Andre, you saw the beauty in me

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:24.626
at a time where
I couldn't see it in myself.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.336
The world is full of inspiration.

00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:28.338
I have never been angry.

00:01:28.422 --> 00:01:30.757
The best revenge is to promote education.

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:33.302
You continue to inspire
a generation of people.

00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:36.180
Billy, if I hadn't heard your voice...

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:38.348
My life would look completely different.

00:01:38.432 --> 00:01:41.810
I realized I am the change
I'm looking for.

00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:45.647
I can't make my life longer,
but I can make it deeper.

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:48.692
Dear Billy.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.027
Dear Malala.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.278
Dear Laird.

00:01:51.361 --> 00:01:52.571
Dear Jane.

00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:53.864
Dear Viola.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:54.948
Dear Sandra.

00:01:55.908 --> 00:01:56.825
Dear Andre.

00:01:56.909 --> 00:01:58.202
Dear Ava.

00:01:58.285 --> 00:01:59.119
Dear Kareem.

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:02.331
What is your voice?

00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:05.792
What are you gonna do with that
small dash of time that you have?

00:02:08.086 --> 00:02:09.588
May we keep riding the big waves.

00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:11.840
May we continue in the fight together.

00:02:11.924 --> 00:02:12.424
Dear Malala.

00:02:12.508 --> 00:02:13.091
Dear Jane.

00:02:13.175 --> 00:02:13.717
Dear Billy.

00:02:15.636 --> 00:02:16.803
Dear Sandra.

00:02:17.346 --> 00:02:21.058
I'm gonna make the claim that
you have the best face in the world.

00:02:22.893 --> 00:02:23.727
Sorry, that's hilarious.

